# Marks TcketManageCoreMigrations as a database initializer so Spring Boot makes
# entityManagerFactory (and anything else annotated @DependsOnDatabaseInitialization)
# wait for core's schema migrations. See TcketManageCoreMigrations for why core cannot
# contribute a Flyway bean and inherit this ordering from Boot's own flywayInitializer.
org.springframework.boot.sql.init.dependency.DatabaseInitializerDetector=\
com.ibrasoft.tcketmanage.autoconfigure.TcketManageMigrationsDatabaseInitializerDetector
